<title>UK: UK Conservatives mulling mail privatisation.</title>
<headline>UK Conservatives mulling mail privatisation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's ruling Conservative party said on Wednesday it would consider different forms of privatisation for the national postal service the Royal Mail.</p>
<p>In its manifesto for the May 1st election, the party said it also planned to transfer Parcelforce to the private sector.</p>
<p>Parcelforce and the Royal Mail are both part of Britain's Post Office.</p>
</text>
